 *
 * Only parent owners (seller) or admin permitted. Fails if reference is invalid or already deleted. Can be used for inventory reduction, error recovery, data purges, etc. Linked with PATCH/GET/POST workflows.
 *
 * @param props - Request properties
 * @param props.seller - The authenticated seller performing the deletion
 * @param props.productOptionId - The parent product option ID
 * @param props.productOptionStockId - Target stock ID for deletion
 * @returns void (operation completes or throws error)
 * @throws {Error} If the product option stock does not exist, has already been deleted, or does not belong to the seller
