 *
 * @param props - Request properties
 * @param props.admin - Admin authentication payload (must be a valid active admin, enforced via decorator)
 * @param props.coinWalletId - The UUID of the wallet for which the snapshot belongs
 * @param props.coinSnapshotId - The UUID of the snapshot to update
 * @param props.body - Updatable metadata/documentation fields (wallet_label, security_code, snapshot_reason)
 * @returns The fully updated coin wallet snapshot record (with all fields, dates as branded strings)
