 * Also logs the deletion event in the seller_histories table, including the previous seller object for audit/compliance evidence.
 *
 * @param props - Request object. Must contain:
 *   - seller: SellerPayload (authentication context)
 *   - sellerId: string & tags.Format<'uuid'> (seller's ID to delete)
