 * @param props.seller - The authenticated seller (seller must own the product of the inquiry)
 * @param props.productInquiryId - UUID of the inquiry for which the snapshot is being created
 * @param props.body - Snapshot input details (title, body, flags, actor, scores, audit timestamp)
 * @returns The created inquiry snapshot (immutable record of point-in-time inquiry state)
 * @throws {Error} If the inquiry does not exist or is deleted
 * @throws {Error} If the seller does not own the product related to the inquiry
