 *
 * Admins update the value, description, or other business fields of an existing system setting record. The operation checks UUID validity, anti-duplication for conf_key, and validates content is meaningful per compliance requirements. All changes result in update timestamps being refreshed and an audit event being logged.
 *
 * Edge cases include attempts to update non-existent or soft-deleted records (report as not found), or conflicts on conf_key uniqueness. Updates must reflect immutability rules and maintain full change traceability.
 *
 * @param props - Request properties
