 * the allowed state transitions per business rules. All date values are handled as string & tags.Format<'date-time'>,
 * and UUIDs are created with v4() strictly typed. No use of Date, no type assertions.
 *
 * @param props - The parameter object
 * @param props.customer - Authenticated customer (JWT payload)
 * @param props.orderId - UUID of the order to update
 * @param props.body - Details of the status transition event (ICreate DTO)
